## 16. Top 5 risks

| Risk | Likelihood / impact | Mitigation |
|---|---|---|
| Google retires or renames a model again | High / High | model ids only in .env; health check on every start; `jarvis doctor`; runbook in FU-4; offline fallback |
| Cost overrun from an open or noisy session | Medium / Medium | metered guard 80/100%, idle timeout, mic gating, Cloud billing alert, Free-tier forbidden for real use |
| Misheard WhatsApp recipient or body | Medium / High | local private capture, fuzzy match with ask-if-ambiguous, mandatory readback and spoken yes, dry-run first, audit |
| Echo self-interrupt (Jarvis hears itself) | High on speakers / Medium | headphones default, AEC toggle, higher VAD threshold plus 250 ms in speaker mode, measured self-interrupt rate |
| WhatsApp Web UI change or account restriction | Medium / Medium | selectors in one file, local HTML fixture test, deep-link fallback, low volume, human-confirmed |
Also watch: prompt injection through web pages or messages (FU-2), Bluetooth latency breaking the 200 ms target (measure wired), Live API behaviour changes (UNVERIFIED items).

